        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "I don't _think_ this is a neovim issue at this point, I had opened up the issue here as well as wezterm since the behavior was so weird and I didn't know how to proceed.\n\nI personally haven't run into this issue in a long while, but that's because I ended up using the workaround of using `wezterm ssh` instead of `ssh` as discussed [here](https://github.com/wezterm/wezterm/issues/6838).\n\nI will try to remember how I was doing this previously and test at work this coming week and get back to you.",
